#: ../../tools/flybase_tools.rst:32 1feb182f8d684173ba53d84c2a099455
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed Drosophila melanogaster (fruit fly) gene "
"information from FlyBase via the Alliance of Genome Resources. Returns "
"gene symbol, name, synopsis, genomic location, synonyms, and cross-"
"references. FlyBase is the primary database for Drosophila genetics. "
"Example: 'FB:FBgn0003996' returns the white (w) gene with its function as"
" an ABCG2-class transporter."
msgstr ""

