"Examples: 'FB:FBgn0003996' (white/w), 'FB:FBgn0000490' "
"(decapentaplegic/dpp), 'FB:FBgn0004647' (Notch/N), 'FB:FBgn0000546' "
"(eyeless/ey), 'FB:FBgn0003731' (hedgehog/hh)."
