#: ../../tools/flybase_tools.rst:100 77c3e8f0ba364bf58672eebcf3c0fb11
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get disease models involving a Drosophila gene from the "
"Alliance of Genome Resources. Drosophila is a powerful model organism for"
" human disease research. Returns genotype-based disease models with "
"associated human disease names and Disease Ontology IDs. Example: "
"'FB:FBgn0000490' (dpp) has 946 disease model entries including models for"
" ALS, Parkinson's disease, and other neurodegenerative conditions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/flybase_tools.rst:104 eaf22951be4e48538f4e726c52d280f7
msgid ""
"``gene_id`` (string) (required) FlyBase gene ID with 'FB:' prefix. "
"Examples: 'FB:FBgn0000490' (dpp), 'FB:FBgn0004647' (Notch/N), "
"'FB:FBgn0003996' (white/w)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/flybase_tools.rst:107 b7268896166b45f58f8d29551270f2a5
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of disease models to return"
" (1-100). Default: 20."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/flybase_tools.rst:127 4e03631934f945468939902c0acda695
msgid "**FlyBase_get_gene_expression** (Type: AllianceGenomeTool)"
