#: ../../tools/flybase_tools.rst:206 baedfe9061f145e8bd64205c502671f9
msgid "**Name**: ``FlyBase_get_gene_orthologs``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/flybase_tools.rst:208 38e099291387486cb3e4f391eadae3a2
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get orthologs of a Drosophila gene across other species "
"from the Alliance of Genome Resources. Returns orthologous genes in "
"human, mouse, zebrafish, worm, yeast, and other model organisms with "
"prediction method details and best-score indicators. Essential for "
"translational research from fly models to human disease genes. Example: "
"'FB:FBgn0004647' (Notch) returns orthologs including human NOTCH1-4."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/flybase_tools.rst:212 08a7e087d1994986a9fe13caf1fb1b10
msgid ""
"``gene_id`` (string) (required) FlyBase gene ID with 'FB:' prefix. "
"Examples: 'FB:FBgn0004647' (Notch/N), 'FB:FBgn0003996' (white/w), "
"'FB:FBgn0000546' (eyeless/ey)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/flybase_tools.rst:215 d38bac9b5ca34188929aa7ba570b9703
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of orthologs to return "
"(1-100). Default: 20."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/flybase_tools.rst:221 c74daf2e3ba141b6be458b1d7e778e3f
msgid ""
"``stringency`` (string) (optional) Stringency filter for orthology calls:"
" 'stringent' (high confidence) or 'moderate'. Default: 'stringent'."
msgstr ""

